    IF v_lesson_id IS NULL THEN INSERT INTO lessons(topic_id,teacher_id,title,description,content,skill_type,order_index,status) VALUES(v_topic_id,v_teacher_id,'Should and shouldn''t for advice','Give and understand advice with should and shouldn''t.','Objective: Give and understand advice with should and shouldn''t.
Content: Use should plus the base verb for good advice. Use shouldn''t plus the base verb for advice about an unhelpful or unsafe action.
Examples:
- You should rest today.
- You shouldn''t skip breakfast.
Common errors and corrections:
- You should to call her. -> You should call her.
- She shoulds leave. -> She should leave.
Guided practice: Identify the problem, then choose positive advice or advice against an action.
Summary: Should gives advice, and shouldn''t gives negative advice; both use the base verb.','GRAMMAR',3,'DRAFT') RETURNING id INTO v_lesson_id; END IF;
